OL,3,APatient living in 'horrific pain' due
OL,4,Ato UK-wide drugs shortage
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman with multiple sclerosis (MS)
OL,7,Fhas said she is living with "horrific
OL,8,Fpain" after being unable to get a drug
OL,9,Fshe uses to manage her condition.
OL,11,FJill Kenning has used Nabilone for 17
OL,12,Fof the 18 years since she was diagnosed
OL,13,Fwith MS and said the drug had been
OL,14,Fvital for managing her pain and helping
OL,15,Fher live a normal life.
OL,17,FShe said she had spent most of her time
OL,18,Fin bed since running out of the drug
OL,19,Flast Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
