OL,3,APatient living in 'horrific pain' due
OL,4,Ato UK-wide drugs shortage
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland's devolved health
OL,7,Fdepartment said there was disruption to
OL,8,Fsupplies of the drug across the UK,
OL,9,Fmeaning Nabilone was out of stock with
OL,10,Fwholesalers and not expected to be
OL,11,Favailable again until December.
